---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "../Layout.astro";
import optimizer from "../assets/optimizer.png";
---

<Layout title="Astro on bunny.net CDN and Optimizer">
  <h1>Astro on bunny.net CDN and Optimizer</h1>
  <p>
    Built with <code>CDN_URL</code> set, scripts, styles, and images load from the pull zone.
    Without it, everything loads from this server.
  </p>

  <h2>Responsive widths</h2>
  <p>Astro builds a <code>srcset</code>, and Optimizer resizes the image for each <code>?width=</code>.</p>
  <Image
    src="/images/hero.png"
    alt="A bunny watching a machine turn HTML into Markdown"
    width={1737}
    height={893}
    layout="constrained"
    loading="eager"
  />

  <h2>Imported images</h2>
  <p>
    An image in <code>src/assets</code> gets a hashed <code>/_astro</code> URL, and goes through
    Optimizer the same way.
  </p>
  <Image src={optimizer} alt="Bunny Optimizer illustration" layout="constrained" quality={50} />

  <h2>Cookies and forms</h2>
  <p><a href="/cookie">Save a cookie with a form post</a> to test a whole-site pull zone.</p>
</Layout>
